{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What can be obtained from the trial version?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains 3 major levels, grassland, forest, snow, and 6 minor levels below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately 20% -30% of the plot in the complete version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">34 in-game unlockable achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two new mechanisms based on basic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>(Note: Playing this game requires a certain understanding of Chinese idioms. If you are completely unfamiliar with this, the author suggests that you do not try this game easily.)</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The Story of Pie Na&quot; is a simple game that combines&quot; filling idioms &quot;and&quot; walking in a maze &quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And on this basis, different game mechanisms are added to enhance players' enjoyment in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722310/extras/3.png?t=1747149017\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will take on the role of a human who has fallen to a different realm, constantly advancing or retreating through &quot;filling in idioms&quot; in order to return to their hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the process of understanding and comprehending traditional idioms, players can also play the role of a &quot;traveler&quot;, &quot;ranger&quot;, and &quot;wanderer&quot; who travels through the world, listening to the stories of each character in the game and deciding whether to get involved, making choices that they will not regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722310/extras/2.png?t=1747149017\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you hold onto your inner choice until you reach the end of your journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those seemingly settled things are quietly undergoing changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722310/extras/1.png?t=1747149017\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722310?t=1747149017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722310?t=1747149017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722310/5651092d204187362542908554240ad03cabc2de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747149017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722310/5651092d204187362542908554240ad03cabc2de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747149017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What can be obtained from the trial version?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains 3 major levels, grassland, forest, snow, and 6 minor levels below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately 20% -30% of the plot in the complete version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">34 in-game unlockable achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two new mechanisms based on basic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>(Note: Playing this game requires a certain understanding of Chinese idioms. If you are completely unfamiliar with this, the author suggests that you do not try this game easily.)</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_pa